sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Learning Brain
    participant M as Coding model
    participant F as Filesystem
    participant D as Job database
    T->>M: Save step checkpoint
    M->>F: Write model and tokenizer to staging folder
    M->>F: Rename staging folder to step-N
    T->>F: Append recorded loss
    T->>D: Update saved step and parameter count
    T-->>T: Notify progress callback
